Cell["\<\
 For a full ket use eigenket[statGRun[\"Points\"][[point]],sector,level], or \
replace statGRun by statDeltaRun. Eigenvalues are never chopped. Both \
bipartitions and IPR use the same retained eigenvectors. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6ed53a21-9ef3-764f-b5a1-b4d7f1b48a38"]
}, Closed]],

