}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
 For complex bulk states the valid relation is \
S[-t;rhoM]=Conjugate[S[t;Conjugate[rhoM]]]. The check conjugates eigenbasis \
coefficients and reuses eigenvectors; it never assumes the same complex bulk \
is time-reversal invariant. Unsampled rows carry Missing[NotSampled]. ZZ \
canonical rates use a 3-by-3 projected dephasing generator plus twelve zero \
rates; its intermediate-map support minimum is shown separately from the full \
Choi minimum, which includes twelve exact zeros. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9a05b43b-2eef-1243-bfff-d93249ef61a9"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
 3.6 Optional infinite-time average across all energy-degenerate sectors \
\>", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"9706af25-4075-3049-8a54-fb545f1667b9"],

