                RowBox[{"texNumber", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], 
                "<>", "\"\<; g=\>\"", "<>", 
                RowBox[{"texNumber", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<g\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", "12"}], 
              "]"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
